{"t":"Demonic Candy Ball","s":"demonic-candy-ball-7a5b8","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Demonic_Candy_Ball_887790.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Demonic Candy Ball</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Demonic Candy Ball\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonic_Candy_Ball_887790.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.50 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 seconds<br/><small>(0% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.60<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 30, 2010<br/>Summer Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20100623221354&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demonic_Candy_Ball_887790.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a demonic candy ball.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 9.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">You're never sure what demonic candy balls will do, but they sure taste sweet and exciting.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Smack.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This food has six random common effects, each with the same chance of happening:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Increases <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Axe Fighting\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Axe_Fighting_Icon_f19657.png\" width=\"9\"/></span></span><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Club Fighting\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Club_Fighting_Icon_05c84b.png\" width=\"9\"/></span></span><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sword Fighting\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sword_Fighting_Icon_053c48.png\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> melee skills (except for <a href=\"#/wiki/Fist%20Fighting\">Fist Fighting</a>) by 3 for an hour.</li>\n<li>Increases <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Distance Fighting\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Distance_Fighting_Icon_30f2a7.png\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> distance skills by 3 for an hour.</li>\n<li>Increases <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shielding\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shielding_Icon_97a059.png\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> shielding skills by 6 for an hour.</li>\n<li>Increases your <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Magic Level\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Level_Icon_d4433d.png\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> magic level by 3 for an hour.</li>\n<li>Increases your <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Speed\"><img alt=\"Speed\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Haste_Icon_105a69.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> speed by 50 levels for an hour.</li>\n<li>Makes you <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Invisibility\"><img alt=\"Invisibility\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Invisible_Icon_ab037d.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisible\">invisible</a> for 10 minutes.</li></ul>\n<p>There's one possible negative effect which happens about 1% of the times you eat it:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Makes you <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Poisoned, <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cursed\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_3dcdcb.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Cursed, <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dazzled\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dazzled_Icon_54545c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Dazzled, <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Burning\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burning_Icon_6a9d24.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Burning, <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Freezing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_68a15e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Freezing and <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Drowning\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_dcd703.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Drowning. This effect makes you lose a total of 364 Hit Points if you wear no equipment that modifies these damage types.</li></ul>\n<p>Additionally, there is an even rarer effect:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Turns your outfit into <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Shapeshifting\"><img alt=\"Shapeshifting\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spellwand_Icon_f4c7a5.png\" width=\"12\"/></span></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Mutated%20Pumpkin\">The Mutated Pumpkin</a> and makes you irradiate <span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff9900; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span> light for a radius of 6 map fields.</li></ul>\n<p>Note that it is possible to stack different effects as you can eat one of this every 10 minutes.\n</p><p>When using a Demonic Candy Ball, Green Sparkles Effect <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Sparkles Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Sparkles_Effect_f26b9f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> will appear on the user who will get one of the following messages: \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You're not exactly sure what it did, but you feel different. Tasted great though!</span>\" (for the common effects) or \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">OUCH! That had somewhat undesired effects. Tasted great though!</span>\" (for the negative effect).\n</p><p><b>Necessary Ingredients:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Candy\">Candies</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy\"><img alt=\"Candy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_419a89.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\">Candy Canes</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\"><img alt=\"Candy Cane\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_Cane_850370.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bars of Chocolate</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\"><img alt=\"Bar of Chocolate\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bar_of_Chocolate_988acd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>15 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbreadman\">Gingerbreadmen</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbreadman\"><img alt=\"Gingerbreadman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gingerbreadman_4309e3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Demonic%20Blood\">Flask of Demonic Blood</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Demonic%20Blood\"><img alt=\"Flask of Demonic Blood\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flask_of_Demonic_Blood_870e63.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li></ul>\n<p>Obtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>This dish is one of the four winning recipes of the Gourmet Competition held by CipSoft in May 2010. The creator of this recipe is Hitogedgy.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Axe Fighting</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy\">Candy</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\">Candy Cane</a></li><li>Club Fighting</li><li>Distance Fighting</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Demonic%20Blood\">Flask of Demonic Blood</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbreadman\">Gingerbreadman</a></li><li>Haste (Condition)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li>Magic Level</li><li>Shielding</li><li>Speed</li><li>Sword Fighting</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"3-2","n":20,"title":"Prato 13: Demonic Candy Balls","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":33068,"y":32531,"z":6,"label":"Jean Pierre"}]},{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"4-0","n":24,"title":"Efeitos dos pratos","kind":"reward","coords":[]}]}}